    {
      "id": "31197672",
      "title": "Setting Navigation Options Dynamically",
      "lectureOrder": 102,
      "videoOrder": 98,
      "sourceHash": "318e02c933162fec65de80272bff7aebd63cf061fdfb4df313673280e3c7bb2c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.6,
          "end": 6.02,
          "en": "So how can we set options dynamically?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.02,
          "end": 9.57,
          "en": "Well, there are a couple of ways of achieving that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.57,
          "end": 13.71,
          "en": "For example, we can use this Options Prop on a screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.71,
          "end": 18.12,
          "en": "configuration component, and instead of passing a object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.12,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "To options, as we did it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 23.06,
          "en": "which is a kind of value you can pass,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.06,
          "end": 27.093,
          "en": "you also pass a function an arrow function, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 31.27,
          "en": "Now this function, if you pass one will then be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.27,
          "end": 33.72,
          "en": "executed by React Navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.72,
          "end": 38.49,
          "en": "and it will receive a object with two pieces of data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.49,
          "end": 40.75,
          "en": "And we can use object De-structuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.75,
          "end": 44.91,
          "en": "here in the argument list to get these two properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 47,
          "en": "that will be part of that object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47,
          "end": 50.91,
          "en": "which we get automatically by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.91,
          "end": 54.883,
          "en": "And that would be the Route and the Navigation Properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.75,
          "end": 58.289,
          "en": "So we get an object with these two properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.289,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "automatically by React Navigation passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 62.87,
          "en": "into this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.87,
          "end": 66.63,
          "en": "When we define such a function here for options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.63,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "and this function will be executed on our behalf",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 71.513,
          "en": "by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.55,
          "end": 74.59,
          "en": "Now this function will be executed whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.59,
          "end": 76.03999999999999,
          "en": "the screen becomes active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.03999999999999,
          "end": 81.03999999999999,
          "en": "and this function should then return an options object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.38,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "So the same kind of object we can set directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 85.923,
          "en": "should be returned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.77,
          "end": 90.31,
          "en": "But since this is a function where we get information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.31,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "about the current route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 96.38,
          "en": "and navigation we can actually set options dynamically here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.78999999999999,
          "end": 99.03999999999999,
          "en": "For example, we know that inside of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.03999999999999,
          "end": 101.22,
          "en": "route, we get our params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.22,
          "end": 103.75,
          "en": "and we could get the Category ID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.75,
          "end": 107.44,
          "en": "by using route params Category ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.44,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "That's how we also the retrieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 112.09,
          "en": "on the meals overview screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.09,
          "end": 115.003,
          "en": "There we also use route params Category ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.17,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "So that is what we could do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 121.54,
          "en": "And then here we could set the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.54,
          "end": 123.823,
          "en": "equal to catId like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.41,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "With that, if we save this we now have the Category ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 133.573,
          "en": "as a title here on this screen, as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.41,
          "end": 136.42000000000002,
          "en": "Of course that's not too useful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.42000000000002,
          "end": 139.12,
          "en": "but we could also use this Category ID now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.12,
          "end": 142.21,
          "en": "to get a category from the dummy data from this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.21,
          "end": 144.54,
          "en": "categories array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.54,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "and then get the title of that category with a certain ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 152.57,
          "en": "We could do that all here in AppJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.57,
          "end": 156.01,
          "en": "So that's one way of setting options dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.01,
          "end": 159.54,
          "en": "and taking route specific, screen specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 160.923,
          "en": "data into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 163.87,
          "en": "Nonetheless, I'll comment this out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.87,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "and I will not use this approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.133,
          "en": "because I wanna show you an alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.07,
          "end": 171.61,
          "en": "The alternative is that you set options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.61,
          "end": 173.433,
          "en": "from inside the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.35,
          "end": 177.11,
          "en": "For this year in the meals overview screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.11,
          "end": 182.11,
          "en": "we can use this navigation prop, which we also get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.17,
          "end": 186.32,
          "en": "We know that we get it because this component is registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.32,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "as a screen and screen components get route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 193.053,
          "en": "and navigation props automatically by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.93,
          "end": 196.81,
          "en": "Now, why do I want to use this navigation prop?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.81,
          "end": 200.17000000000002,
          "en": "Because this navigation prop does not just have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.17000000000002,
          "end": 201.7,
          "en": "that navigate method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.7,
          "end": 204.63,
          "en": "which we used in a different place before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.63,
          "end": 209.63,
          "en": "but this prop also has a setOptions method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.89,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "And this setOptions method takes an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.78,
          "en": "which then will be set as options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.78,
          "end": 218.98,
          "en": "And therefore this options object takes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.98,
          "end": 220.81,
          "en": "all the configuration items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.81,
          "end": 223.42000000000002,
          "en": "all the properties we saw before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.42000000000002,
          "end": 225.663,
          "en": "and we see here in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.06,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "So now here, we could also get our categories title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 235.11,
          "en": "by for example, also importing this categories array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.11,
          "end": 238.29,
          "en": "and we're already getting the categoryId here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 238.29,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "And then we would get the categoryTitle simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 244.85,
          "en": "by using our categories array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.85,
          "end": 248.03,
          "en": "and finding an item with the Default Find method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.03,
          "end": 251.06,
          "en": "which is part of vanilla JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.06,
          "end": 253.58,
          "en": "which takes a function that should return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.58,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "for the item we're looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.7,
          "end": 257.793,
          "en": "and falls for other items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 262.36,
          "en": "And this function then gets every category",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.36,
          "end": 266.91,
          "en": "because this will be executed for every item in categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 266.91,
          "end": 268.41,
          "en": "And here I wanna return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.41,
          "end": 271.36,
          "en": "if categoryId is equal to catId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 271.36,
          "end": 275.67,
          "en": "because then I know that I found the category with that ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.67,
          "end": 277.43,
          "en": "And I wanna store the title here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 277.43,
          "end": 282.43,
          "en": "so on that object return by find I access the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.65999999999997,
          "end": 284.25,
          "en": "Theoretically this could be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.25,
          "end": 287.38,
          "en": "but we know that it won't be here because the only way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.38,
          "end": 290.76,
          "en": "of reaching this screen is through a navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.76,
          "end": 293.84000000000003,
          "en": "action that did set a valid categoryId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.79,
          "end": 296.94,
          "en": "And then we got the title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.94,
          "end": 300.88,
          "en": "We can therefore set the title option to categoryTitle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "If we do that and save this, that works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 307.853,
          "en": "and now we have to categoryTitle here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 309.03,
          "end": 312.92,
          "en": "You will also notice that I get a warning down there though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 312.92,
          "end": 315.8,
          "en": "also on Android where it also works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 315.8,
          "end": 317.2,
          "en": "but I do get this warning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 318.12,
          "end": 321.59,
          "en": "and I do get this warning because of how I set options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 321.59,
          "end": 324.89,
          "en": "I'm setting it like this directly in the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 324.89,
          "end": 327.07,
          "en": "and you should not do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.07,
          "end": 330.08299999999997,
          "en": "Instead you should use, useEffect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 331.22,
          "end": 336.15999999999997,
          "en": "So therefore we can import useEffect from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.78,
          "end": 342.5,
          "en": "And useEffect allows us to process this side effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 342.5,
          "end": 347.003,
          "en": "and setting the options of this screen is a side effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 347.90999999999997,
          "end": 351.18,
          "en": "So then here we can use useEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 351.18,
          "end": 354.693,
          "en": "past as a fact function and the dependencies array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 355.56,
          "end": 357.39,
          "en": "And then we wanna get the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 357.39,
          "end": 360.52,
          "en": "and set the options inside of useEffact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 360.52,
          "end": 363.63,
          "en": "And our dependencies there for are the catId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 363.63,
          "end": 366.56,
          "en": "and this navigation prop object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.56,
          "end": 370.17,
          "en": "These are the two external things we use inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 370.17,
          "end": 371.83,
          "en": "of this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 371.83,
          "end": 373.46,
          "en": "Categories is also external,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 373.46,
          "end": 375.44,
          "en": "but not part of the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 375.44,
          "end": 377.12,
          "en": "it's being imported instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 377.12,
          "end": 380.883,
          "en": "And therefore this will now set the options properly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 381.98,
          "end": 384.87,
          "en": "With that if we saved as in reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 384.87,
          "end": 388.25,
          "en": "indeed, you will notice that the warning is gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 388.25,
          "end": 389.65,
          "en": "but you will also notice that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 389.65,
          "end": 393.35,
          "en": "now the title isn't set as smoothly as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 393.35,
          "end": 396.53,
          "en": "instead it's jumps after the page has been loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 396.53,
          "end": 399.78,
          "en": "So it's only set after the screen has been loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 399.78,
          "end": 403.463,
          "en": "It's not set whilst the animation is in progress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.93,
          "end": 407,
          "en": "Now this happens because useEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 407,
          "end": 409.63,
          "en": "actually executes this effect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.63,
          "end": 412.33,
          "en": "after the component function was executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 412.33,
          "end": 413.7,
          "en": "for the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 413.7,
          "end": 416.05,
          "en": "That's why it's looking that ugly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 416.05,
          "end": 421.05,
          "en": "This can be fixed by using the useLayoutEffect hook instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 422.11,
          "end": 424.48,
          "en": "The chances are that you may have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 424.48,
          "end": 426.41,
          "en": "never used this hook before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 426.41,
          "end": 429.44,
          "en": "because indeed you do rarely need to use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 429.44,
          "end": 431.93,
          "en": "but you can use it in situations like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 431.93,
          "end": 436,
          "en": "where you typically have some kind of ongoing animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 436,
          "end": 437.33,
          "en": "and you wanna set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 437.33,
          "end": 442.33,
          "en": "or execute some side effect whilst this is still happening,",
